        { ime: "A trip to Eryri (Snowdonia)", opis: "If you have another day or two, the north of Wales offers the highest Welsh peak, Yr Wyddfa (Snowdon), with a rack railway to the top, and the mighty castles of Edward I at Caernarfon and Conwy.", link: "https://eryri.gov.wales/" }
